Z||000010||88 Fiero||10-25-1999||10:16 PM||||Greg...check out this website... <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/fl/tcf...guy" TARGET=_blank>www.angelfire.com/fl/tcf...guy</A>  build a custom sub-box on his fiero... it is mounted on the foot-well on the passenger side and you can't even tell..The Sub-Box looks like factory... Also, I think he is selling the custom fiberglass box...check it out...you might like that set-up...<p>[This message has been edited by 88 Fiero (edited 10-26-1999).]||||reg||1
